    "detailed_description": "A Lone Piece is a single-player chess game with a twist. You are a single pawn destined to fight or flee the opposing pieces. This game is all about:<br><br>\u265f\ufe0f  You against everyone. Outsmart all the other pieces <br>\u265f\ufe0f  Eat them to get power-ups<br>\u265f\ufe0f  Defeat the evil king<br>\u265f\ufe0f  Endless amount of procedurally generated levels that get increasingly more difficult<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180920/extras/62724d241ed2c740d2d9332b85776323.poster.avif?t=1731052261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180920/extras/62724d241ed2c740d2d9332b85776323.webm?t=1731052261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2180920/extras/62724d241ed2c740d2d9332b85776323.mp4?t=1731052261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u265a Opponents you know and love \u265a</h2><br>\u2659 Pawn is a simple and predictable piece. <i>But you better watch out if it gets to the other side</i><br>\u2656 Rook is a defending powerhouse. There's no way of escaping when it's securing the exit<br>\u2658 There is unpredictable and then there is Knight<br>\u2657 With Bishop in the board, you have to be careful right from the start. They like to attack<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u265a For everyone \u265a </h2><br>\u2655 Puzzles get increasingly harder based on your skills. Starts with 4x4 grid against one piece and gradually turns to full board and 16 pieces<br>\u2655 A good way to teach chess to children as well as mental workout for more adult taste<br>\u2655 Whether you're a seasoned chess player or a newcomer to the game, increasing difficulty makes sure you will have enough of a challenge<br>\u2655 Up your mental game? Checkmate<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid